# Shared setup for the breakable-cache loot tests: both players by the smashed boxes south-west of the Ruins camp,
# where hero 0 slot 60 has 6 spilled pickups lying (2 coins and a log can still be taken). The including scenario sets the loot rule.

default hero 0
default slotA 60
default slotB 60
include session.coop
A tp -100,30
B tp -90,30
sleep 4
A expect spill >= 3 timeout=10
B expect spill >= 3 timeout=10
A expect spill <= 3 timeout=1
